###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Nothing in schema 0.1.2 describes an uncertainty estimate (no class for an uncertainty method, no metric for calibration or sharpness), as for ho2026. The underlying models are a feed-forward network on Gaussian multipole (GMP) descriptors with a shared SingleNN latent space, which matches no registry method, and a pretrained GemNet-OC (registry method GemNet) whose checkpoint is not specified; no accuracy of these models is reported in a form that could be encoded (energy MAEs appear only in the out-of-distribution analysis as figures and appendix tables).
# - Data sets named: MD17 aspirin (211K frames, PBE+vdW-TS), QM9 (130K molecules, B3LYP/6-31G(2df,p)) and OC20 S2EF. Read from the arXiv v2 preprint; arXiv id matched by title and author.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
